           "title": "Computer Engineer | Graphics Designer",
           "short_bio": "Full Stack Developer (Django & Vue) | Graphic Designer with 4+ years of experience. Passionate about building scalable apps and compelling designs.",
           "description": "I am a Computer Engineer and Full Stack Developer with expertise in Django and Vue JS, dedicated to building scalable, efficient, and user-friendly web applications. With over four years of experience in Graphic Design, I specialize in crafting visually compelling brand identities and digital assets that enhance user engagement.\r\n\r\nBeyond my technical skills, I have a strong background in leadership and community engagement. I served as the President of the Rotaract Club of Pokhara University, where I led initiatives in professional development, community service, and networking. Additionally, as the Campus Director for the Hult Prize at Pokhara University, I played a key role in fostering entrepreneurship and social innovation, guiding students to develop impactful startup ideas.\r\n\r\nWith a blend of technology, design, and leadership experience, I am passionate about creating innovative solutions that drive meaningful impact.",
